    "name": "ledger-api",
    "summary": "FastAPI service: accounts, double-entry postings, idempotent transfers, monthly statements",
    "description": "ledger-api is the HTTP API of Ledgerly. It records double-entry postings, serves POST /v1/transfers with X-Idempotency-Key, renders monthly statements as PDF. Talks to ledger-postgres and ledger-redis, pulls bank feeds through Plaid. Synonyms: ledger service, transfers API, accounts API, posting engine."
   }
  },
